# Offline and Async Jobs

## Offline (staff only)

Allowed offline: take attendance, enter scores, view today's timetable. Never queue payments, publishing, approvals, or admin edits.

1. Serwist caches app shell, staff dashboard, allocated class lists, today's timetable.
2. Dexie `outbox`: `{ clientRef, entity, action, payload, clientTimestamp, status }`. `clientRef = crypto.randomUUID()` at mark time.
3. Sync on `online` and every 30s: `POST /sync/batches` with Idempotency-Key. Statuses: `applied`, `duplicate`, `conflict`, `rejected`.
4. Header sync chip: Offline | Syncing N | All synced | N need attention.
5. Conflicts: `GET /sync/conflicts`; resolve with `keepServer` / `applyClient` only if `offline-sync.conflict.resolve`.
6. Locked registers / submitted assessments reject offline edits — show server reason.

## Async jobs (202)

Batch invoices, promotions, imports, exports, report runs, backups, report-card regeneration.

- Poll `statusUrl` every 2s (backoff to 10s) via `useAsyncJob`.
- `<AsyncJobBanner>` survives navigation (small client store); toast on finish; invalidate queries.

## Parent payments

Never mark success from gateway redirect alone. Return page polls invoice until paid (≤60s) or shows "confirming". Checkout uses Idempotency-Key from Pay screen mount.
